      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The leaded skeleton is hit by a melee attack</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> A cloud of lead dust is released, forming a 5-foot radius cloud of fine particles surrounding the skeleton. The cloud persists for 1 round, exposing creatures within it to an inhaled form of rapid lead poison.</p>",
