      "name": "Rapid Lead Poison",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p>High amounts of lead can cause headache, difficulty concentrating, and joint pain. Necromantic magic has augmented the lead that infuses this skeleton, causing it to take effect far more quickly than is typical for lead poisoning.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 18 Fortitude Saving Throw</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> Stupefied 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> 1d6 Poison Damage damage, stupefied 1, and Clumsy 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> 2d6 Poison Damage damage, Stupefied 2, and Clumsy 2 (2 rounds)</p>",
